{
    "title": "When: Last Seen Online Tracker",
    "description": "Do you want to be sure that your children are safe? Or do you want to control how much time they spend on messaging apps? Track their online/offline activities in real-time with push notifications.\r\n\r\nThe WHEN Family Online Tracker app is designed to help you achieve this by monitoring and analyzing the online activity of your children.\r\n\r\nWhen is an application designed to help you keep track of the online time your children spend in messaging apps. It allows you to keep track of when they are online and when they are offline. It also allows families to see detailed statistics based on the time their children spend online. It's an app designed with extra security measures so you can make sure your kids are online safely. The possibilities offered by When help families manage their children's online time and emphasize the importance of the time they spend securely in messaging applications.\r\n\r\n\r\nFollow your family's online activities with WHEN. \r\n\r\n- Monitor your kids.\r\n- Real time Online/Offline status \r\n- Between family profiles\r\n- Get instant notifications when your family go online \r\n- Delete your data whenever you want \t\t\t\t\r\n- Monitor the online/offline status of their family members \r\n- Analyze data with detailed reports. \r\n- Download reports to your device \r\n- Customize monitoring experience with time tags \r\n- Balance the online statuses of your children \r\n- View the duration of sessions for child \r\n- View all time intervals \r\n- 24/7 customer service\r\n\r\n\r\nTrack your family's online activities with WHEN.\r\n\r\nYour data will belong to you at any time and you can delete it with one touch.\r\n\r\nHow can you access your child's activities? Now it's time to get rid of worries! With When, you can check the online / offline status of your kids; In this context it is an ideal option!\r\n\r\nWhen is the perfect match for you to help you reduce your worries and doubts. Feel safer by downloading it for free and enjoy life by making the right decisions with When!\r\n*This app is not associated with or affiliated with any app. You will not receive any access permission.\r\n\r\nAll product and company names are registered trademarks of their original owners. The use of any trade name or trademark is for identification and reference purposes only and does not imply any affiliation with the trademark owner of the product mark.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you want to be sure that your children are safe? Or do you want to control how much time they spend on messaging apps? Track their online/offline activities in real-time with push notifications.<br><br>The WHEN Family Online Tracker app is designed to help you achieve this by monitoring and analyzing the online activity of your children.<br><br>When is an application designed to help you keep track of the online time your children spend in messaging apps. It allows you to keep track of when they are online and when they are offline. It also allows families to see detailed statistics based on the time their children spend online. It&#39;s an app designed with extra security measures so you can make sure your kids are online safely. The possibilities offered by When help families manage their children&#39;s online time and emphasize the importance of the time they spend securely in messaging applications.<br><br><br>Follow your family&#39;s online activities with WHEN. <br><br>- Monitor your kids.<br>- Real time Online/Offline status <br>- Between family profiles<br>- Get instant notifications when your family go online <br>- Delete your data whenever you want \t\t\t\t<br>- Monitor the online/offline status of their family members <br>- Analyze data with detailed reports. <br>- Download reports to your device <br>- Customize monitoring experience with time tags <br>- Balance the online statuses of your children <br>- View the duration of sessions for child <br>- View all time intervals <br>- 24/7 customer service<br><br><br>Track your family&#39;s online activities with WHEN.<br><br>Your data will belong to you at any time and you can delete it with one touch.<br><br>How can you access your child&#39;s activities? Now it&#39;s time to get rid of worries! With When, you can check the online / offline status of your kids; In this context it is an ideal option!<br><br>When is the perfect match for you to help you reduce your worries and doubts.